# Form Input Limits (NIK & Nomor HP)

Baca skill proyek: `.cursor/skills/form-input-limits/SKILL.md`

## Wajib

1. **Backend**: `ValidationHelper::nikRules()` / `nomorHpRules()` / `teleponRules()` — jangan hardcode `digits:16` atau regex HP sendiri.
2. **Blade baru**: `{!! ValidationHelper::renderInputAttributes(ValidationHelper::nikInputAttributes()) !!}` atau `nomorHpInputAttributes()`.
3. **Field name**: gunakan `nik`, `no_ktp`, `nomor_hp`, `no_hp`, `pic_nomor_hp`, `telepon`, atau `Telepon` agar `public/js/input-limits.js` otomatis membatasi input.
4. **Layout standalone** (di luar `layouts/app`): include `@include('partials.input-limits-script')`.

## Jangan

- Hardcode `maxlength="16"` tanpa helper (kecuali form legacy yang sudah ada — JS global tetap backup).
- Tambah validasi NIK/HP duplikat di controller; extend `ValidationHelper` jika perlu field name baru.
- Terapkan digit-only ke `email_or_phone` (login boleh email).

## Sumber kebenaran

`app/Helpers/ValidationHelper.php` — `NIK_LENGTH`, `NOMOR_HP_MAX`, `NIK_FIELD_NAMES`, `PHONE_FIELD_NAMES`.
